[playful, attention-grabbing, teasing tone]

Arey suno! Ramayana dekhne ja rahe ho? [slight pause] Pehle Bhabhi ki sun lo! [mischievous laugh] 60 second mein bata dungi — paisa vasool hai ya nahi!

[confident, conversational storytelling]

Kahani to sabko pata hai — Ram, Sita, vanvas, Ravan. [short pause]

[impressed, enthusiastic tone]

Nitesh Tiwari ne isko bahut bade scale pe banaya hai! Ranbir Kapoor Ram bane hain, Sai Pallavi Sita, aur Yash Ravan!

[playful emphasis]

Ab bhaiya, asli sawaal hai — film dekhne layak hai ya nahi?